## Domain rules the back office must keep

- Freeze and unfreeze go through `Card.freeze()` / `unfreeze()`, then `CardMapper.applyDomainState`. A frozen card declines in `authorize` with `DeclineReason.CARD_FROZEN`.
- `changeCreditLimit` only on `CreditCard`. `changeLimit` throws if the new limit is below `amountUsed`. `Money.of` throws if the amount is negative or has more than 2 decimal places. `OfficeBean` catches that and sets `flash` / `flashError`.
- Search filters in memory on masked number, kind, and status, after `listCards()`. Empty query returns every card.

